them a powerful mind-tool\n- Strong body#WHITE#\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"雪人是克拉克半岛寒冷山脉中的原始物种，尽管他们是双足行走、高度进化的动物，他们仍然缺乏真正的意识。\n他们极其强壮的身躯覆盖白色毛皮，但是他们的心灵十分脆弱。\n克鲁克部落的灵能科技找到了一种方法侵入雪人的身体，将他们自己的意识转移进去来强化部落的战斗力。\n\n你已经帮忙抓住了足够多的雪人，你现在可以创造新的种族：#LIGHT_GREEN#雪人#WHITE#。\n\n种族特色：#YELLOW#\n- 寒冰之怒，使用它们故乡恶劣的气候来冻结他们的敌人。\n- 脑波冲击，控制雪人的兽人仍然保留着一小部分灵能，让他们拥有强大的心灵武器。\n- 强大的身躯#WHITE#\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"225bdbf7d20991418694b889d3cad8c92ceb36b893f603b771de5b616b108f01","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"f3717325ea4141b81c44d029cceb77876d386123dad06643266acb506ca00d21","logical_entry_identity":"b03ae925610377e6b9a21ca15fba68cb6179a5a42abaa87a9e7359ef9e702e8c","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"This troll carries a large sword and shield, and appears to be wearing segments of armor.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这只巨魔拿着巨大的剑盾，身上穿了一些零碎的护甲。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"36a4014b657ca7cfc3957834617319fa1111e4a850566d4e118a2f783b3ef9ed","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"f378040a81a23ab8eb046ad3a2e58388f0cf3831166112de97a76348b1b7544c","logical_entry_identity":"95a0e6f2ab08bee5eb8dbedad74e07b9ffa99b4dc4ec89c4c3e209b860082b6c","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"heavy lined cloak","source_tag":"_t","target":"厚重的夹层披风"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2f74827234c3bb21b9a35a59f7b9b557d3ff4c8c59c4e9a0104ede072de69a30","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"f398f02999c3245d232cca4ff858ec5e1ea6a71040f4a2b38aab8707327f4bdb","logical_entry_identity":"49809b8a3fa96265b96fcd1600616ea3323430408ab1ccc3dbc7c55cb791457d","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*#{bold}#DESTRUCTICUS, IMPOLITE PENETRATOR OF THE SKY#{normal}# stands before you, and as much as it pains you to admit it, Kaltor's advertisement wasn't flattering enough.  This may be the most unreasonably lethal device you've ever seen.  The sunlight, gleaming off its voratun body, seems dull compared to the intensely glowing mass of unstable runes on its tip; its surface has the ornate grooves of a metal that has been psionically reforged through hours of migraine-inducing concentration.  The bayonet mounted on the launching tube just seems like gloating.  This particular model appears to be equipped with an enclosed, fireproof booth around its control panel, and a built-in tea dispenser in said booth, which your fellow orcs have already taken the liberty of filling with looted Dwarven ale.  It is truly a thing of beauty.*#WHITE#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*#{bold}#裂天者 毁灭号#{normal}# 站在你面前，让你痛苦地承认，卡托尔的广告还远不够夸耀。这可能是你见过的最无端致命的设备。阳光照耀在它的沃瑞钽躯壳上，与它尖端那团散发着炽烈光芒的不稳定符文相比显得黯淡；它的表面有着华丽的沟槽，那是经过数小时令人头痛欲裂的专注心灵锻造重塑的金属。发射管上安装的刺刀仿佛在炫耀一般。这个型号似乎还配备了一个密封防火的控制舱，舱内有一台内置的茶饮机，你的兽人同胞们已经擅自往里面灌满了抢来的矮人麦酒。这真是一件美得惊人的造物。*#WHITE#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bcf7d2c78cba783ed2b10c96cb89deba4d9d9692b838743b10953cc8101f1c77","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"f3bb901575962ab506ac99865a124e3f2b3f8151032d274182ed8f5875441b2c","logical_entry_identity":"3560b8f0d8e44bec3f4d9bef17f3cc1e93b02de43f2d5c89672497bfcbab20dd","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*Before you stands a strange triangular device, some kind of automated storage facility.*#WHITE#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*你面前有一个奇怪的三角形设备，似乎是某种自动存储设施。*#WHITE#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"73427ffde6721390edca456e1869a02d642ce15da9b795bacd837775a8883fdc","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"f3c179175f8dceca1d5fa83cb7e35957cabd75b9ecc2ed3154872cd4b2ef9260","logical_entry_identity":"c7765a21345aaadbabfba178bca523ee5e48b974632efde1d34cc48ad72825e6","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"lump of steel","source_tag":"ingredient name","target":"钢块"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cd0125a8b488ee6b0bc596839e404a4c9300ee2b0e699b987a8d740a99556957","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"f3c45cc69c4eccbc03fe76160b59b3d3b8043a1d317b06caba4d2eab8f264066","logical_entry_identity":"d957188e2dc934da3e046ada5386ce9f262694dbc25